  "description": "Operating Area: Bali, Komodo, Sumbawa, Indonesia\n\nBhavana is a heritage expedition phinisi conceived as a true passion project, uniting refined comfort, authentic Indonesian craftsmanship, and purposeful ocean exploration into one cohesive identity. Her name, drawn from the Sanskrit concept of “cultivation of the mind,” reflects the intention that guests arrive curious and depart renewed, peaceful, and mentally restored. Inspired by the clarity and calm felt after a meaningful dive, Bhavana delivers access to Indonesia’s most extraordinary waters and an enduring sense of balance and perspective.\n\nRooted in traditional phinisi craftsmanship and enriched with a Peranakan heritage design Rooted in traditional phinisi craftsmanship and enriched with a Peranakan heritage design philosophy, she blends cultural authenticity with sophisticated detailing. Positioned within the top tier of Indonesia’s expedition charter market, Bhavana is tailored for discerning families with older children and dedicated divers seeking immersive experiences. A fully equipped dive platform integrates with spacious cabins, social areas, and a curated onboard lifestyle. Bhavana represents refined sailing, timeless elegance, heritage-inspired design, and journeys that cultivate clarity, connection, and discovery at sea.",
